It also includes three of Mika's skills from core/src/main/resources/skills/
at the same commit: skills/messaging/ (unmodified), and skills/info-research/
and skills/content-transcribe/, modified to name pig's tools in place of
Mika's; each modified file says so at its top.

src/TreeQuality.php follows the rules and thresholds of Mika's
core/src/main/kotlin/com/wangzan101/mika/core/uistate/TreeQuality.kt,
rewritten in PHP for uiautomator's XML.

helper/src/pig/androiduse/helper/ShellContext.java builds the shell context the way
scrcpy (https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy, Apache-2.0) made known, and
AgentDisplay.java chooses the display flags, the keyboard policy and the
keep-awake reports as Mika's ShellService.kt and DisplayAwake.kt do; both are
written anew for this package.

